## Third-Party Components and Licenses

This template integrates with the following Microsoft services:
- SharePoint Online (Microsoft 365 License Required)
- Power Automate (Microsoft 365 License Required)
- Power BI (Power BI License Required)

## Framework References

This template implements processes based on the following frameworks:
- TOGAF® is a registered trademark of The Open Group
- ITIL® is a registered trademark of AXELOS Limited
- NIST standards are in the public domain (U.S. Government works)
- FedRAMP® is a registered service mark of the U.S. General Services Administration

The template does not include proprietary framework content, but rather provides
a structure for implementing these frameworks within your organization.
